#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:1
#: 09b88d1a8c3f4ddca569d37b9d8dac55
msgid "Field commissioning"
msgstr "现场调试"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:3
#: 555855c15dfa48e285d5a9cb5b430e44
msgid ""
"For on-site engineers who unpack a workspace, bring up the robot, and run"
" teleop or a browser view."
msgstr "面向现场工程师：解开工作空间、拉起机器人，再跑遥操作或浏览器画面。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:5
#: 7b3b6024f167406799cdbdcc8d8c05de
msgid "1. Deploy from a field zip (deploy-ws)"
msgstr "1. 用现场 zip 部署（deploy-ws）"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:7
#: 1b00e6494fb84fd5adb1a16b238d8aad
msgid ""
"Public lean branches document a **zip** path: unzip, then `./release.sh "
"--install`, then `./quick_start.sh`. Descriptions stay as source; "
"controllers and hardware interfaces come from `.deb`."
msgstr ""
"公开精简分支写了 **zip** 路径：解压，然后 `./release.sh --install`，再 "
"`./quick_start.sh`。描述包仍用源码；控制器和驱动层来自 `.deb`。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:9
#: f7fbda71c77943289a3f92383e013eb1
msgid ""
"[Go to Real "
"Hardware](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/0-index.md) — "
"safety, robot table, which branch to use."
msgstr ""
"[部署到真实机器人](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/0-index.md) — "
"安全、机器人表、该用哪个分支。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:10
#: cc5a94f4e5f34e76a64b593f2b728a24
msgid ""
"[ARX Lift "
"2S](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md) — field "
"zip, then `./quick_start.sh` (split body / full body)."
msgstr ""
"[方舟无限 Lift "
"2S](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md) — 现场 "
"zip，然后 `./quick_start.sh`（分体 / 全身）。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:11
#: 6dd01c60391f4e2e9aa4b69615aff8bc
msgid ""
"[HighTorque Panthera "
"HT](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md) — field"
" zip (`~/ht-deploy-ws` example), `./release.sh --install`, "
"`./quick_start.sh`."
msgstr ""
"[高擎 Panthera "
"HT](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md) — 现场 "
"zip（示例目录 `~/ht-deploy-ws`）、`./release.sh --install`、`./quick_start.sh`。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:13
#: c91772c83de14f7fa0da412d5ae65eca
msgid ""
"Git clone + `./init_repo.sh` is the development path on the same pages. "
"Extra flags and robot IDs for **fa-deploy-ws** are only in that "
"workspace’s README after access: [fa-deploy-ws "
"Setup](../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md)."
msgstr ""
"同一页上也有 git clone + `./init_repo.sh` 的开发路径。**fa-deploy-ws** 的额外参数和机器人 ID "
"只在开通后的该仓库 README 里：[fa-deploy-ws "
"配置](../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md)。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:15
#: ee921366c1064d4cb75b3866cb8cbd70
msgid "2. Deploy fa-py-libraries (zip or git)"
msgstr "2. 部署 fa-py-libraries（zip 或 git）"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:17
#: 9a7a8ce952f44d8198aacfa2f13395da
msgid ""
"On-site Python tools (interface, Viser, VR) come from [fa-py-"
"libraries](../4-reference/python_apps/2-fa_py_libraries.md)."
msgstr ""
"现场 Python 工具（接口、Viser、VR）来自 [fa-py-"
"libraries](../4-reference/python_apps/2-fa_py_libraries.md)。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:19
#: ef007a9e3ad4498cafd3d78c04119309
msgid "Git: `git clone` then `./init.sh all` (Python 3.12 env)."
msgstr "Git：`git clone` 然后 `./init.sh all`（Python 3.12 环境）。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:20
#: c3bbbb7a162b410aa7ea09102d4b7ce6
msgid ""
"Field zip: the [fa-py-libraries README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/fa-py-libraries/blob/main/README.md) documents `./release.sh` "
"(`--package-no-git` is the smaller zip). After unzip: `./init.sh install`"
" (and the optional XRoboToolkit `./init.sh` lines only if you use that VR"
" backend)."
msgstr ""
"现场 zip：[fa-py-libraries README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-"
"libraries/blob/main/README.md) 写了 `./release.sh`（`--package-no-git` "
"体积更小）。解压后执行 `./init.sh install`（仅在使用 XRoboToolkit 这条 VR 后端时，再跑可选的 "
"`./init.sh` 行）。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:22
#: 1be208caf6ae46c094eab28d21394daf
msgid "Then launch with `./run.sh` or a direct subcommand from that README."
msgstr "然后用 `./run.sh` 或该 README 里的直接子命令启动。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:24
#: 29b9559660e14b4496aa0292522788bf
msgid "3. Start VR teleop"
msgstr "3. 启动 VR 遥操作"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:26
#: 0a0fb2f8ea674162bfcc09ad97e18a6c
msgid ""
"[VR Teleop](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md) — Pico Enterprise"
" vs consumer, WebXR (`./run.sh vr`) vs XRoboToolkit (`./run.sh vr-xrt`)."
msgstr ""
"[VR 遥操作](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md) — Pico "
"企业版与消费版、WebXR（`./run.sh vr`）与 XRoboToolkit（`./run.sh vr-xrt`）。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:27
#: f4c73b1f6ec54f0a8aa185306c012482
msgid ""
"Same commands are listed on [fa-py-"
"libraries](../4-reference/python_apps/2-fa_py_libraries.md)."
msgstr ""
"同样的命令也列在 [fa-py-"
"libraries](../4-reference/python_apps/2-fa_py_libraries.md)。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:29
#: b296fea4021b4a9e8bfbf72dc907833a
msgid ""
"The robot stack (deploy-ws `./quick_start.sh` or the launch on the how-"
"to) must already be running. Headset SKU notes stay on the VR page."
msgstr ""
"机器人栈（deploy-ws 的 `./quick_start.sh` 或操作指南中的 launch）必须已经在跑。头显 SKU 说明仍在 VR "
"页。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:31
#: c80a937319324c37a09c3ee9f307cca7
msgid "4. Start Viser (browser view)"
msgstr "4. 启动 Viser（浏览器画面）"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:33
#: 04df2ba3b57b4b0b81afc13cbb719f02
msgid ""
"Bring up the robot so `/robot_description` and `/joint_states` are "
"published."
msgstr "先拉起机器人，让 `/robot_description` 和 `/joint_states` 在发布。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:34
#: 3e1d70afcaa44f6aae8e4a08c92faabd
msgid ""
"From fa-py-libraries: `./run.sh viser` — "
"[ros2-viser](../4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md), [fa-py-"
"libraries](../4-reference/python_apps/2-fa_py_libraries.md)."
msgstr ""
"在 fa-py-libraries 中：`./run.sh viser` — "
"[ros2-viser](../4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md)、[fa-py-"
"libraries](../4-reference/python_apps/2-fa_py_libraries.md)。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/1-field_commissioning.md:36
#: 5baa63608c504fc6bb157ea90b54c141
msgid ""
"Viser is a **browser** 3D view. The ros2-viser README also documents "
"optional **FSM** and **gripper** panels (`enable_fsm_panel` / "
"`enable_gripper_panel`, default on). There is no separate “phone app” or "
"host/port flag in this docs set; open the Viser page the library prints, "
"including from another device on the same network if that URL is "
"reachable."
msgstr ""
"Viser 是 **浏览器** 三维画面。ros2-viser README 还写了可选的 **FSM** 和 **夹爪** "
"面板（`enable_fsm_panel` / `enable_gripper_panel`，默认开启）。本文档没有单独的「手机 App」或 "
"host/port 参数；打开库打印出的 Viser 页面即可。同一网络上其他设备若能访问该 URL，也可以打开。"

